  "description": "A standalone payload-inspection node for FluxFlow: classify a byte/text payload (JSON, XML, base64, text, binary, empty) and broadcast a result with bounded previews, plus error/event ports. No engine required.",
  "id": "FluxFlow.Components.Payloads",
