  "published": "2026-06-19T14:20:22.56Z",
  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Rebuilt as a single standalone payload.inspect node over the FluxFlow.Nodes kit: a PayloadInspectionRequest in, a PayloadInspectionResult broadcast out (carrying the correlation id), failures on the error port, a diagnostic on the event port. The node factory, module/registration glue, component-type and port constants, the definition-based options reader, and the design-metadata provider are removed — classification logic, options, contracts, and error codes are unchanged. The node depends only on FluxFlow.Nodes and runs without the engine.",
